{"id":325,"slug":"325-literal-types-trong-typescript-la-gi","category":"TypeScript","subcategory":"Types Nhập Môn","level":"intermediate","question_vi":"Literal types trong TypeScript là gì?","question_en":"What are literal types in TypeScript?","answer_vi":"Literal type là kiểu chỉ nhận **đúng một giá trị cụ thể**.\n\n```typescript\ntype Direction = 'left' | 'right' | 'up' | 'down'\ntype Port = 80 | 443\ntype Flag = true\n\nlet d: Direction = 'left'\nd = 'top'    // Lỗi: không nằm trong 4 giá trị cho phép\n```\n\nDùng thay `enum` mà **không sinh code lúc chạy**:\n\n```typescript\n// enum: sinh ra một object trong bundle\nenum Status { Loading, Success, Error }\n\n// literal union: bị xoá hoàn toàn khi biên dịch\ntype Status = 'loading' | 'success' | 'error'\n```\n\n**Lưu ý — TypeScript mở rộng kiểu khi dùng `let`:**\n\n```typescript\nconst a = 'left'     // kiểu: 'left'   — literal\nlet b = 'left'       // kiểu: string   — bị mở rộng!\n\nfunction go(d: Direction) {}\ngo(b)                // Lỗi: string không gán được cho Direction\n```\n\nGiữ literal bằng `as const`:\n\n```typescript\nlet b = 'left' as const                    // 'left'\n\nconst config = { dir: 'left' } as const     // { readonly dir: 'left' }\nconst dirs = ['left', 'right'] as const     // readonly ['left', 'right']\ntype D = (typeof dirs)[number]              // 'left' | 'right' — suy ra union từ mảng\n```\n\n**Chốt:** literal type là nền tảng của **discriminated union** và **thu hẹp kiểu** — hai công cụ quan trọng nhất khi mô hình hoá trạng thái trong TypeScript","answer_en":"A literal type accepts **exactly one specific value**.\n\n```typescript\ntype Direction = 'left' | 'right' | 'up' | 'down'\ntype Port = 80 | 443\ntype Flag = true\n\nlet d: Direction = 'left'\nd = 'top'    // Error: not one of the four allowed values\n```\n\nThey replace `enum` **without emitting runtime code**:\n\n```typescript\n// enum: creates an object in the bundle\nenum Status { Loading, Success, Error }\n\n// literal union: erased entirely at compile time\ntype Status = 'loading' | 'success' | 'error'\n```\n\n**The most important pitfall — TypeScript widens the type with `let`:**\n\n```typescript\nconst a = 'left'     // type: 'left'   — literal\nlet b = 'left'       // type: string   — widened!\n\nfunction go(d: Direction) {}\ngo(b)                // Error: string is not assignable to Direction\n```\n\nKeep the literal with `as const`:\n\n```typescript\nlet b = 'left' as const                    // 'left'\n\nconst config = { dir: 'left' } as const     // { readonly dir: 'left' }\nconst dirs = ['left', 'right'] as const     // readonly ['left', 'right']\ntype D = (typeof dirs)[number]              // 'left' | 'right' — union derived from the array\n```\n\n**Takeaway:** literal types underpin **discriminated unions** and **narrowing** — the two most valuable tools for modelling state in TypeScript","answer_html_vi":"<p>Literal type là kiểu chỉ nhận <strong>đúng một giá trị cụ thể</strong>.</p><div class=\"qa-code-wrap\"><span class=\"qa-code-lang\">typescript</span><button type=\"button\" class=\"qa-code-copy\" data-code=\"type Direction = 'left' | 'right' | 'up' | 'down'\ntype Port = 80 | 443\ntype Flag = true\n\nlet d: Direction = 'left'\nd = 'top'    // Lỗi: không nằm trong 4 giá trị cho phép\" aria-label=\"Copy code\"><svg class=\"qa-code-copy-icon-default\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect x=\"9\" y=\"9\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"/><path d=\"M5 15H4a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h9a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v1\"/></svg><svg class=\"qa-code-copy-icon-done\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"/></svg><span class=\"qa-code-copy-label-default\">Copy</span><span class=\"qa-code-copy-label-done\">Copied</span></button><pre class=\"qa-code-pre\"><code class=\"qa-code-block hljs\"><span class=\"hljs-keyword\">type</span> <span class=\"hljs-title class_\">Direction</span> = <span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;left&#x27;</span> | <span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;right&#x27;</span> | <span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;up&#x27;</span> | <span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;down&#x27;</span>\n<span class=\"hljs-keyword\">type</span> <span class=\"hljs-title class_\">Port</span> = <span class=\"hljs-number\">80</span> | <span class=\"hljs-number\">443</span>\n<span class=\"hljs-keyword\">type</span> <span class=\"hljs-title class_\">Flag</span> = <span class=\"hljs-literal\">true</span>\n\n<span class=\"hljs-keyword\">let</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">d</span>: <span class=\"hljs-title class_\">Direction</span> = <span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;left&#x27;</span>\nd = <span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;top&#x27;</span>    <span class=\"hljs-comment\">// Lỗi: không nằm trong 4 giá trị cho phép</span></code></pre></div><p>Dùng thay <code>enum</code> mà <strong>không sinh code lúc chạy</strong>:</p><div class=\"qa-code-wrap\"><span class=\"qa-code-lang\">typescript</span><button type=\"button\" class=\"qa-code-copy\" data-code=\"// enum: sinh ra một object trong bundle\nenum Status { Loading, Success, Error }\n\n// literal union: bị xoá hoàn toàn khi biên dịch\ntype Status = 'loading' | 'success' | 'error'\" aria-label=\"Copy code\"><svg class=\"qa-code-copy-icon-default\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect x=\"9\" y=\"9\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"/><path d=\"M5 15H4a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h9a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v1\"/></svg><svg class=\"qa-code-copy-icon-done\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"/></svg><span class=\"qa-code-copy-label-default\">Copy</span><span class=\"qa-code-copy-label-done\">Copied</span></button><pre class=\"qa-code-pre\"><code class=\"qa-code-block hljs\"><span class=\"hljs-comment\">// enum: sinh ra một object trong bundle</span>\n<span class=\"hljs-keyword\">enum</span> <span class=\"hljs-title class_\">Status</span> { <span class=\"hljs-title class_\">Loading</span>, <span class=\"hljs-title class_\">Success</span>, <span class=\"hljs-title class_\">Error</span> }\n\n<span class=\"hljs-comment\">// literal union: bị xoá hoàn toàn khi biên dịch</span>\n<span class=\"hljs-keyword\">type</span> <span class=\"hljs-title class_\">Status</span> = <span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;loading&#x27;</span> | <span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;success&#x27;</span> | <span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;error&#x27;</span></code></pre></div><p><strong>Lưu ý — TypeScript mở rộng kiểu khi dùng <code>let</code>:</strong></p><div class=\"qa-code-wrap\"><span class=\"qa-code-lang\">typescript</span><button type=\"button\" class=\"qa-code-copy\" data-code=\"const a = 'left'     // kiểu: 'left'   — literal\nlet b = 'left'       // kiểu: string   — bị mở rộng!\n\nfunction go(d: Direction) {}\ngo(b)                // Lỗi: string không gán được cho Direction\" aria-label=\"Copy code\"><svg class=\"qa-code-copy-icon-default\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect x=\"9\" y=\"9\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"/><path d=\"M5 15H4a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h9a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v1\"/></svg><svg class=\"qa-code-copy-icon-done\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"/></svg><span class=\"qa-code-copy-label-default\">Copy</span><span class=\"qa-code-copy-label-done\">Copied</span></button><pre class=\"qa-code-pre\"><code class=\"qa-code-block hljs\"><span class=\"hljs-keyword\">const</span> a = <span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;left&#x27;</span>     <span class=\"hljs-comment\">// kiểu: &#x27;left&#x27;   — literal</span>\n<span class=\"hljs-keyword\">let</span> b = <span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;left&#x27;</span>       <span class=\"hljs-comment\">// kiểu: string   — bị mở rộng!</span>\n\n<span class=\"hljs-keyword\">function</span> <span class=\"hljs-title function_\">go</span>(<span class=\"hljs-params\"><span class=\"hljs-attr\">d</span>: <span class=\"hljs-title class_\">Direction</span></span>) {}\n<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">go</span>(b)                <span class=\"hljs-comment\">// Lỗi: string không gán được cho Direction</span></code></pre></div><p>Giữ literal bằng <code>as const</code>:</p><div class=\"qa-code-wrap\"><span class=\"qa-code-lang\">typescript</span><button type=\"button\" class=\"qa-code-copy\" data-code=\"let b = 'left' as const                    // 'left'\n\nconst config = { dir: 'left' } as const     // { readonly dir: 'left' }\nconst dirs = ['left', 'right'] as const     // readonly ['left', 'right']\ntype D = (typeof dirs)[number]              // 'left' | 'right' — suy ra union từ mảng\" aria-label=\"Copy code\"><svg class=\"qa-code-copy-icon-default\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect x=\"9\" y=\"9\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"/><path d=\"M5 15H4a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h9a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v1\"/></svg><svg class=\"qa-code-copy-icon-done\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"/></svg><span class=\"qa-code-copy-label-default\">Copy</span><span class=\"qa-code-copy-label-done\">Copied</span></button><pre class=\"qa-code-pre\"><code class=\"qa-code-block hljs\"><span class=\"hljs-keyword\">let</span> b = <span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;left&#x27;</span> <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">as</span> <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">const</span>                    <span class=\"hljs-comment\">// &#x27;left&#x27;</span>\n\n<span class=\"hljs-keyword\">const</span> config = { <span class=\"hljs-attr\">dir</span>: <span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;left&#x27;</span> } <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">as</span> <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">const</span>     <span class=\"hljs-comment\">// { readonly dir: &#x27;left&#x27; }</span>\n<span class=\"hljs-keyword\">const</span> dirs = [<span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;left&#x27;</span>, <span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;right&#x27;</span>] <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">as</span> <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">const</span>     <span class=\"hljs-comment\">// readonly [&#x27;left&#x27;, &#x27;right&#x27;]</span>\n<span class=\"hljs-keyword\">type</span> D = (<span class=\"hljs-keyword\">typeof</span> dirs)[<span class=\"hljs-built_in\">number</span>]              <span class=\"hljs-comment\">// &#x27;left&#x27; | &#x27;right&#x27; — suy ra union từ mảng</span></code></pre></div><p><strong>Chốt:</strong> literal type là nền tảng của <strong>discriminated union</strong> và <strong>thu hẹp kiểu</strong> — hai công cụ quan trọng nhất khi mô hình hoá trạng thái trong TypeScript.</p>","answer_html_en":"<p>A literal type accepts <strong>exactly one specific value</strong>.</p><div class=\"qa-code-wrap\"><span class=\"qa-code-lang\">typescript</span><button type=\"button\" class=\"qa-code-copy\" data-code=\"type Direction = 'left' | 'right' | 'up' | 'down'\ntype Port = 80 | 443\ntype Flag = true\n\nlet d: Direction = 'left'\nd = 'top'    // Error: not one of the four allowed values\" aria-